  unitName: Charming Threat Savia
  unitId: 20674
  unitNumber: 1093
  description: The queen of Estoria and leader of a national alliance in ancient
    Ishgria. In olden times, there was a demon ruler in Ishgria which encouraged
    other demons to fight each other in order to gain enormous power. However, by
    the time Savia had gained the same leadership position, she had grown tired of
    all the endless fighting. It was then when the new and innovative nation of Mildran
    made its appearance, defeating countless demons along the way.
  summonDesc: A world full of insolent beings<br>would not be missed, don't you agree?<br>Why
    do I bother with this struggle?
  fusionDesc: This is so tedious.<br>Can't you do this<br>in a better fashion somehow?
